<title>UK: Monte dei Paschi sets $150 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Monte dei Paschi sets $150 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MONTE DEI PASCHI DI SIENA</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   ISS PRICE  99.978    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   REOFFER    99.978</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/GB/IT/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
